  "description": "<p>If you make multiple changes or create multiple versions within a second you should only get the last one for each second.</p>\n\n<p>This works for RDF serializations.</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>&gt; curl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http://localhost:8080/rest/test_version/bb4351ba-1293-4082-8a1e-aeb010be2aac/fcr:versions\r\n \r\n@prefix memento: &lt;http://mementoweb.org/ns#&gt; .\r\n@prefix rdf:   &lt;http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&gt; .\r\n@prefix fedora: &lt;http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#&gt; .\r\n@prefix ldp:   &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#&gt; .\r\n&lt;http://localhost:8080/rest/test_version/bb4351ba-1293-4082-8a1e-aeb010be2aac/fcr:versions&gt;\r\n        ldp:contains           &lt;http://localhost:8080/rest/test_version/bb4351ba-1293-4082-8a1e-aeb010be2aac/fcr:versions/20210225134305&gt; ;\r\n        memento:original       &lt;http://localhost:8080/rest/test_version/bb4351ba-1293-4082-8a1e-aeb010be2aac&gt; ;\r\n        fedora:created         \"2021-02-25T13:43:05.215950Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\r\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2021-02-25T13:43:05.215950Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\r\n        fedora:createdBy       \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\r\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\r\n        rdf:type               ldp:Resource ;\r\n        rdf:type               ldp:Container ;\r\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource .\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>But not for <tt>application/link-format</tt></p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>&gt; curl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http://localhost:8080/rest/test_version/bb4351ba-1293-4082-8a1e-aeb010be2aac/fcr:versions -H\"Accept: application/link-format\"\r\n\r\n&lt;http://localhost:8080/rest/test_version/bb4351ba-1293-4082-8a